msgctxt "116"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "Salve?"

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Hey. It's Kashiwagi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Kashiwagi-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"I have something urgent to discuss with you. How quickly can\r\n"
"you be in Tokyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "I'm actually already here. In Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Yeah. And I have something to talk about too, Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Where are you now?"
msgstr "Dove si trova in questo momento?"

msgctxt "212"
msgid "At Stardust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Stardust? But the cops are crawling all over that place.\r\n"
"Did something happen over there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Just a little run-in with the Nishikiyama Family.\r\n"
"Don't worry, I handled it. Is everything okay with you,\r\n"
"Kashiwagi-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "Come mai lo chiedi?"

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Well, this guy Hasebe from the Nishikiyama Family... He said\r\n"
"you're in danger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"I see. Then we should meet sooner rather than later. Can you\r\n"
"come now, Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Yeah. The Kazama Office work for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Of course. See you soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Mi sembra una buona idea."

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Oh, and as much as it pains me to say, a lot of people out\r\n"
"there want you dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Try to keep a low profile on your way to the Millennium\r\n"
"Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "I will. Later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "All good?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "It should be, yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"They seemed to believe me when I told them it was just some of our younger "
"hosts getting a bit too heated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Even so, you should stay vigilant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"The police are still out front. They'll surely want to\r\n"
"question you if you walk out now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "...Guess I'm stuck here for now, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "I doubt they'll stick around much longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Actually. Can you go check on them for us, Yuya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "You got it!"
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "584"
msgid "There's something I need to talk to you about, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "Cos'è?"

msgctxt "608"
msgid "It concerns Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"This city has changed in the two years since you've left,\r\n"
"Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"Or perhaps it would be better to say the Tojo Clan has\r\n"
"changed. More specifically their power structure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"It has to do with the Nishikiyama Family. They've always\r\n"
"been... forceful, to say the least. Even with their old bosses\r\n"
"Nishikiyama-san and Shindo in charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"But ever since this new guy has taken the reins, their\r\n"
"bloodlust has been uncontrollable. They're trying to seize every last shop in Kamurocho, even those under Tojo control."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "I can't imagine Kashiwagi-san would take that sitting down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"True enough. But as the captain of the Tojo Clan, he makes\r\n"
"it a point to avoid internal conflict whenever possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"Most shops have been able to resist the Nishikiyama advances\r\n"
"given their long history with the Kazama Family, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "But something's changed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid ""
"Yes. At first it was just vague threats and attempts at\r\n"
"coercion, but it seems recently the Nishikiyama Family's\r\n"
"come into a massive sum of money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "So they're bribing all the holdouts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"Exactly. Their stake in Kamurocho has expanded nearly\r\n"
"tenfold over the past year."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"And they don't care that their newfound territory's coming\r\n"
"from another Tojo family? So much for honor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"Of course, the Kazama Family won't stand by and let their\r\n"
"stores be snatched away. Tensions have been extremely high."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"Nobody's sure what may be the spark that sets off a\r\n"
"full-fledged yakuza war... but most people seem to believe\r\n"
"it's coming one way or another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid ""
"More likely than not, that's why the Nishikiyama Family\r\n"
"wants our club. To use as their base of operations during that war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"Makes sense. It's not far from the Kazama office over in the\r\n"
"Millennium Tower, and it's one of the biggest shops in town."
msgstr ""

